# Solutions and Starter Code

This notebook exercises the reveal buttons (`webnb.allowRevealingSolutions`) and the `+default` reset button.

A JavaScript exercise with a solution and explicit starter code:

```{javascript}
// Task: implement double(n) so the test passes.
function double(n) {
  // TODO
}
```
```+test
wrap(double(4)).should('equal', 8).run('double(4) should be 8', 'double works');
```
```+solution
function double(n) {
  return n * 2;
}
```
```+default
