  // TODO
}
```

An HTML exercise with a solution but no authored starter — editing it captures the
original text as the default automatically:

```{html}
<p>Make this a heading</p>
```
```+solution
<h1>Make this a heading</h1>
```

A multiple choice question with an explanation for when answers are revealed:

```{mcq}
Which method adds an element to the end of an array?
shuffle: false
[x] push
[ ] pop
[ ] shift
```
```+solution
`push` appends to the end. `pop` removes from the end, and `shift` removes from the front.
```

A multiple choice question without an explanation:

```{mcq}
Which keyword declares a constant?
shuffle: false
[x] const
[ ] let
[ ] var
```
